	SAY DESC "This blade belonged to Dabbar, a long-dead servant of Bhaal that exercised control over his minions in the most brutal of ways. This powerful sword absorbs life energy from an opponent with each successful hit, healing the user. Dabbar considered it a failure of his officers if he returned from battle in less than perfect health, and as the rest of the company watched, he would administer beatings until fully healed.

