	SAY DESC "Power can corrupt even the noblest of mages, and the long-lived elves of Faerûn have seen what devastating consequences can occur when a mage loses control. This elegant longsword, its silver hilt decorated with clear blue gems, was crafted to deal with arcane spellcasters who have abused their gift. The sword assists any hunter who tracks down out-of-control mages.

